<title>USA: GM to release Q2 results July 16.</title>
<headline>GM to release Q2 results July 16.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp said Thursday it plans to release its second quarter earnings at 0800 EDT/1200 GMT July 16.</p>
<p>Results for General Motors Acceptance Corp will also be released July 16 with GM's consolidated results.</p>
<p>GM's Hughes Electronics Corp is scheduled to release its results on July 15 at 1030 EDT/1430 GMT.</p>
</text>
